<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <title>
    <%= title %>
  </title>
  <link rel='stylesheet' href='/content/app.css' />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free/css/all.min.css" />
  <script src="/script/app.js"></script>
  <script src="bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
</head>

<body>
  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark bg-dark">
    <div class="container-fluid">
      <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">INFR3120</a>
      <button class="btn-icon navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="drawer" data-bs-target="#navbarDrawer"
        aria-controls="navbarDrawer" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
        <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="drawer-body mb-2 md:mb-0">
        <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
          <li class="nav-item">
            <% if (title=="Home" ) {%>
              <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="/"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i></i>Home</a>
              <% } else { %>
                <a class="nav-link" aria-current="page" href="/"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i></i>Home</a>
                <% } %>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item">
            <% if (title=="About me" ) {%>
              <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="/aboutme"> <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
                About me</a>
              <% } else { %>
                <a class="nav-link" aria-current="page" href="/aboutme"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i></i>About
                  me</a>
                <% } %>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item">
            <% if (title=="Projects" ) {%>
              <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="/projects"> <i
                  class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i>
                Projects</a>
              <% } else { %>
                <a class="nav-link" aria-current="page" href="/projects"> <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project"></i>
                  Projects</a>
                <% } %>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item">
            <% if (title=="Contact me" ) {%>
              <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="/contact"> <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> Contact
                me</a>
              <% } else { %>
                <a class="nav-link" aria-current="page" href="/contact"> <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i> Contact
                  me</a>
                <% } %>
          </li>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <h1>Welcome to My <%= title %> Page</h1>
  <% if (title=="Home" ) {%>
    <div id="wrapper">
      <h2>This is the home page of my Website, you can find the navigation features in the top right of your screen.
        I
        hope you enjoy it!</h2>
    </div>
    <% } %>
      <% if (title=="About me" ) {%>
        <div id="wrapper">
          <h2>I am a second year student studying Networking and IT Security here at Ontario Tech University!</h2>
          <img src="/assets/images/Photo.jpg" width="220" height="120" alt="Photo of Myself">
          <!-- "alt" came from W3C Markup Validation Service -->
          <h1>My Video</h1>
          <video controls width="320" height="220" poster="/assets/images/Photo_Poster.jpg" id="video" preload loop
            muted>
            <source src="/assets/images/Assignment_1_Video.mov" type="video/mp4">
            <source src="/assets/images/Assignment_1_Video.mov" type="video/ogg">
          </video>
        </div>
        <% } %>
          <% if (title=="Projects" ) {%>
            <div id="wrapper">
              <h3>My First Project: Python Calculator</h3>
              <p>My first ever coding project was done in a high school design class, and it was to create a simple
                python
                calculator. While relatively technically easy, I still find it one of my most enjoyable projects yet, as
                it
                was the first time I had ever experimented with code, and learned how to create.</p>
              <h3>My Second Project: Phonebook Dictionary</h3>
              <p>This project was completed during my first year of university here at Ontario Tech, in semester one.
                The
                goal
                of this project was to create a working phonebook that had full functionality as well as saving within a
                dictionary. Being the first real project that I had worked on in Python, this project was most certainly
                a
                learning experience.</p>
              <h3>My Third Project: Government Filing Cabinet</h3>
              <p>I completed this project during my first year at Ontario Tech, but in semester two. The objective of
                this
                program was to simulate a filing cabinet that government entities would use on its citizens for any
                administrative purposes needed. This was the first time that I had worked with classes as well as
                inheritance, and used it in the project to differentiate between citizens, such as by comparing
                immigrants
                to native residents.</p>
              <h3>My Fourth Project: Web and Script Assignment 1</h3>
              <p>Project 1 for this class is the fourth major project that I have created in coding related classes.
                Compared to other
                projects, this one is certainly a more unique experience, especially as this is the first time coding
                out of
                Python. Additionally, creating this project has given me a much deeper appreciation of web design as a
                whole.</p>
            </div>
            <% } %>
              <% if (title=="Contact me" ) {%>
                <div id="wrapper">
                  <form action="mailto:alvin.li@ontariotechu.net?subject=Feedback_Regarding_Website" method="post"
                    enctype="text/plain" name="feedback">
                    <p>
                      <label for="firstName">Enter your First Name</label>
                      <input type="text" id="firstName" size="32" placeholder="Enter your First Name" required>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <label for="lastName">Enter your Last Name</label>
                      <input type="text" id="lastName" size="32" placeholder="Enter your Last Name" required>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <label for="email">Enter your Email Address</label>
                      <input type="email" id="email" size="32" placeholder="Enter your Email Address" required>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <label for="phone">Enter your Phone Number Here (optional)</label>
                      <input type="tel" id="phone" size="32" placeholder="Enter your Phone Number Here">
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <label for="message">Enter your Message</label><br>
                      <textarea name="message" id="message" cols="60" rows="8" placeholder="Enter your Message Here"
                        required></textarea>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      <input type="submit" value="Submit">
                    </p>
                  </form>
                </div>
                <% } %>
                  </p>
                  <div id="footer">
                    <h1>My Github!: https://github.com/alvin-li2</h1>
                    <h2>My LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/alvin-li-6270b6384/</h2>
                  </div>
</body>

</html>